{
  "description": "Preserve and strictly decode dynamic inquiry fields. A read-only 2025-12-08 sandbox scan of 166 inquiries verified string, choices, multi_choices, boolean, number, date, generic document, government ID, selfie, and empty JSON field values without retaining provider IDs or customer data. Persona's bundled field-schema-json contract identifies stored JSON values as free-form JSON documents.",
